(g) fraudulently exports goods claiming that such goods were manufactured or produced in a special economic zone for the purpose of obtaining any benefits granted to the United Republic under an international or regional agreement or treaty, commits an offence and on conviction shall be liable to a fine of not less than five million shillings and not more than fifty million shillings or to imprisonment for a term of not less than six months and not more than five years or both.

