(c) adopt a code of conduct.
(3) The Minister may specify in a direction under subsection
(2) a time within which the Authority shall submit its report on the inquiry and if so, the Authority shall submit its report to the Minister within that time.
(4) The Authority shall give notice of an inquiry by-
