(b) on request and on payment of the prescribed fee to any other person who is a member of the company or of any other body corporate dealt with in the report by virtue of section 222, or whose interests as a creditor of the company or any such other body corporate as above appear to the court to be affected, or whose conduct is referred to in the report;
