(a) the expression “director” in relation to a company includes any person in accordance with whose directions or instructions the directors of the company are accustomed to act;
(b) the expression “place of business” includes a share transfer or share registration office;
(c) the expression “offer document” has the same meaning as when used in relation to a company incorporated under this Act; and
(d) the expression “secretary” includes any person occupying the position of secretary by whatever name called. [s. 443] Offer Documents

