(c) prepare appropriation accounts in accordance with the Public Finance Act;
(d) prepare annual accounts in accordance with generally accepted accounting practice in respect of all its transactions.
(2) The accounts of the Commission shall be audited by the Controller and Auditor-General in respect of each financial year.
