60.–(1) A dominant licensee shall not take advantage of its power in a market for the supply of electronic and postal services with a view to-
(a) eliminating or substantially damaging another licensee in the market in which it operates or in any other market;
(b) preventing the entry of any other person in that market or any other market; and
