(c) any form or condition on which the service is provided.
(3) Subsection (2)(a), shall not prevent a dominant licensee from making a reasonable allowance, subject to the approval of the Authority, for the cost of providing an electronic and postal services where the difference results from-
(a) different quantities in which the service is supplied;
