(2) The following conditions shall be observed in connection with the promotion and conduct of the lottery:
(a) the promoter of the lottery shall be a member of the society authorised in writing by the governing body of the society to act as the promoter;
(b) a remuneration shall not be paid in respect of the lottery to the promoter or to any person employed by the promoter in connection with the lottery who carries on a betting business or is otherwise engaged by way of business in the organisation of betting;
