(h) a ticket shall not be sent through the post to a person not being a member of the society;
(i) a person shall not be admitted to participate in the lottery in respect of a ticket or chance except after payment to the promoter of the whole price of the ticket or chance, and no money received by the promoter for or on account of a ticket or chance shall in any circumstances be returned; and
(j) a payment on account of expenses or prizes shall not be made out of moneys of the society other than proceeds of the lottery.

