(c) an agreement to sell and deliver any produce lawfully produced from a community forest reserve;
(d) an agreement to employ or hire the services of any person or organisation to assist the Group in the management of a community forest reserve;
(e) an agreement to occupy any land or buildings to be used in connection with the management of a community forest reserve; and
