(e) seize or suspend the distribution, sale or use of any plant, plant products, pesticide or regulated articles, which he has reason to believe is being distributed, sold or used in contravention of the provisions of this Act;
(f) handle and dispose garbage from conveyance in manner prescribed in the regulations;
