(i) participate in deliberations and proceedings of government, government commissions, regulatory Commission authorities and other bodies in relation to competition and consumer welfare;
(j) make representations to government, government commissions, regulatory authorities and other bodies on matters related to competition and consumer welfare;
(k) consult with consumer bodies, regulatory authorities, business organisations and other interested persons;
(l) consult with the competition authorities of other countries;
